@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.TeamFarisModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Faris Ristiansyah";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Our Team</p>
                <h2>Faris Ristiansyah</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A generalist whose journey started as a job,
                    but gradually became a deeper process of learning, understanding, and growing alongside others.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Generalist</span>
                    <span>Learning</span>
                    <span>Growth</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="team-profile-hero-img reveal">
                <img src="/images/team/faris.jpg" alt="Faris Ristiansyah">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">His Beginning</p>
                <h3>From Work to Meaning</h3>

                <p>
                    For Faris, his journey with Kopi Cinta began with something simple—a job.
                </p>

                <p>
                    But over time, it became a deeper process of learning and self-discovery.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>His Role</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Generalist</li>
                    <li>Multi-role support</li>
                    <li>Adaptable collaboration</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Experience</p>
                <h3>Learning Alongside Deaf Friends</h3>

                <p>
                    One of the most meaningful parts of Faris’s experience
                    has been working directly alongside Deaf friends.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Not just collaborating,
                    but also learning to understand sign language—
                    something that slowly became part of him.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Growth</p>
                <h3>Curiosity That Keeps Expanding</h3>

                <p>
                    What started as a job gradually turned into genuine curiosity—
                    to understand more, to be more involved,
                    and to grow alongside the journey itself.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>His Reflection</h3>
            <p>
                Faris hopes what Kopi Cinta does can reach more people
                and open more space for everyone to understand one another.
            </p>
            <p>
                For him, understanding does not start with perfection—
                it starts with willingness.
            </p>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Team</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>